The IEfCoreDbContext interface inherits from IDbContextDependencies and other interfaces, which have many members. Implementing a full fake is complex. Instead, I will mock the dependencies and focus on the ILogger call by mocking the UnitOfWorkManager and related dependencies, and I will create a minimal stub class implementing IEfCoreDbContext with explicit interface implementation throwing NotImplementedException for all members to satisfy the generic constraint.

